WEBVTT

00:10:58.792 --> 00:11:03.268
It's access, it's a password
or access to something.

00:11:03.292 --> 00:11:06.559
Have you got something, just yes or no,
with a password in your head?

00:11:06.583 --> 00:11:07.851
Allan: Yes.

00:11:07.875 --> 00:11:09.976
DB: A computer password,
that sort of thing?

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.268
Allan: Yes.

00:11:11.292 --> 00:11:12.559
DB: Excellent!

00:11:12.583 --> 00:11:14.268
(Laughter)

00:11:14.292 --> 00:11:17.101
In that case, I'm going
to finish on this one. Let me ---

00:11:17.125 --> 00:11:18.976
If I get this right,

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:22.434
they're all going to know what it is,
and millions of people potentially.

00:11:22.458 --> 00:11:23.934
You will change it, won't you?

00:11:23.958 --> 00:11:25.268
Allan: Of course.

00:11:25.292 --> 00:11:28.000
(Laughter)

00:11:28.958 --> 00:11:31.434
DB: Just say "of course" again?
Allan: Of course.